.org/content/Coruscate/Coruscate_-_Bu-Bustin_Out_130_BPM_4.mp3", "local_path" : "/var/www/ccmixter/content/Coruscate/Coruscate_-_Bu-Bustin_Out_130_BPM_4.mp3", "file_rawsize" : 8276472}], "upload_description_plain" : "9/20/2010 - Extended pella and mix\r\nExtended pella A and B are what I used to make my mix. I got it mostly right on both so I provided both...\r\n\r\nI built this off of a MusicRadar.com construction kit with the vocal \"Bustin out\" in the middle. So I wrote it after the kit. \"Punk Lo Fi Disco\" sample kit 1.\r\nI've included my mix. You can also use my mix of myself.\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm\r\nBu-busting out\r\nwithout a doubt I'm\r\nBu-busting out\r\nAnd freaking out\r\n\r\nWe're\r\nBu-busting out\r\nWe're getting down\r\nBu-busting out\r\nRocking this town\r\n\r\nWe're\r\nBu-busting out\r\nMaking you jump\r\nBu-busting out\r\ncome feel this funk\r\n\r\n\r\nBu-busting out like the man from Shawshank\r\nAnd I got a mental case from being locked in the tank so\r\nga-gather round let the music surround and get down\r\nin town like suspects on the ground but\r\n\r\nbut get on up gyrating locomotion\r\nexplosion in this potion of musical commotion\r\nma-mangle words ver-verbal alchemy so\r\nget with this oto no renkinjutsushi\r\n\r\nFre-freak frequencies frequently for free\r\nand sow musical seeds and leave secretly the\r\nEye of the storm is beyond the norm and performs\r\nLike a deiform maelstrom (Ha)\r\n\r\nPa-packing pistols aint taking no bull\r\nHarmonica goes hunting for Frank Wolfe so\r\nJust throw the door and pay the cover and\r\nBu-bust the floor with these music lovers\r\n\r\n===================\r\n\r\nsay \r\nwho who is that who is dressin so bland\r\nbut kicking a sparkling sound worth a thousand grand it's\r\nCo-coruscate the musical fiend, I\r\nKee-keep you up like too much caffeine I\r\n\r\nMi-mix on up punk rock and roll\r\nthrow in lo fi and a just a touch of disco and \r\nJu-Jump right off the music radar\r\nlike a blackbird built in the fog of war\r\n\r\nBri-bring the rain, adjust the treble,\r\npra-practice skills, take it up a level and\r\nBu-bust this dirty, fi-filthy bass\r\njust so unearthly, moving this place\r\n\r\nju-just won't stop, ju-just won't quit\r\nJustice hammer! too legit.\r\nJust A bad pun. And a knee slap.\r\nIts kind of catchy, just like the clap", "upload_description_html" : "9/20/2010 - Extended pella and mix<br />\r\nExtended pella A and B are what I used to make my mix. I got it mostly right on both so I provided both&#8230;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI built this off of a MusicRadar.com construction kit with the vocal &#8220;Bustin out&#8221; in the middle. So I wrote it after the kit. &#8220;Punk Lo Fi Disco&#8221; sample kit 1.<br />\r\nI&#8217;ve included my mix. You can also use my mix of myself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI&#8217;m<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\nwithout a doubt I&#8217;m<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\nAnd freaking out<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe&#8217;re<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\nWe&#8217;re getting down<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\nRocking this town<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe&#8217;re<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\nMaking you jump<br />\r\nBu-busting out<br />\r\ncome feel this funk<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBu-busting out like the man from Shawshank<br />\r\nAnd I got a mental case from being locked in the tank so<br />\r\nga-gather round let the music surround and get down<br />\r\nin town like suspects on the ground but<br />\r\n<br />\r\nbut get on up gyrating locomotion<br />\r\nexplosion in this potion of musical commotion<br />\r\nma-mangle words ver-verbal alchemy so<br />\r\nget with this oto no renkinjutsushi<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFre-freak frequencies frequently for free<br />\r\nand sow musical seeds and leave secretly the<br />\r\nEye of the storm is beyond the norm and performs<br />\r\nLike a deiform maelstrom (Ha)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPa-packing pistols aint taking no bull<br />\r\nHarmonica goes hunting for Frank Wolfe so<br />\r\nJust throw the door and pay the cover and<br />\r\nBu-bust the floor with these music lovers<br />\r\n<br />\r\n===================<br />\r\n<br />\r\nsay <br />\r\nwho who is that who is dressin so bland<br />\r\nbut kicking a sparkling sound worth a thousand grand it&#8217;s<br />\r\nCo-coruscate the musical fiend, I<br />\r\nKee-keep you up like too much caffeine I<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMi-mix on up punk rock and roll<br />\r\nthrow in lo fi and a just a touch of disco and <br />\r\nJu-Jump right off the music radar<br />\r\nlike a blackbird built in the fog of war<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBri-bring the rain, adjust the treble,<br />\r\npra-practice skills, take it up a level and<br />\r\nBu-bust this dirty, fi-filthy bass<br />\r\njust so unearthly, moving this place<br />\r\n<br />\r\nju-just won&#8217;t stop, ju-just won&#8217;t quit<br />\r\nJustice hammer! too legit.<br />\r\nJust A bad pun. And a knee slap.<br />\r\nIts kind of catchy, just like the clap"},{"upload_id" : 17734, "upload_name" : "DirtBag (Club Mix)", "upload_extra" : {"usertags" : "club,disco,funky,male_vocals", "ccud" : "media,remix,bpm_125_130", "systags" : "attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR", "featuring" : "Brad Sucks", "bpm" : 129.5, "relative_dir" : "content/scomber", "nsfw" : false, "last_op" : "add", "num_reviews" : 3}, "user_name" : "scomber", "upload_tags" : "media,remix,bpm_125_130,club,disco,funky,male_vocals,attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR", "upload_num_scores" : 2, "file_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/files/scomber/17734", "user_real_name" : "ScOmBer", "artist_page_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/people/scomber", "license_logo_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/ccskins/shared/images/lics/small-by.png", "license_url" : "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/", "license_name" : "Attribution", "upload_date_format" : "Sun, Nov 16, 2008 @ 3:06 AM", "qrank" : 8, "files" : [{"file_id" : 19147, "file_upload" : 17734, "file_name" : "scomber_-_DirtBag_(Club_Mix).mp3", "file